  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FD2">Lemma <span data-tag="0FD2">33.9.5</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $X$ be a proper geometrically reduced scheme over $k$. The following are equivalent </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$H^0(X, \mathcal{O}_ X) = k$, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X$ is geometrically connected. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
